====Usage notes====
* Some authorities object to the use of {{m|en||reference}} as a verb with a meaning other than “provide a list of references for,” preferring {{m|en|refer|refer to}} or {{m|en|cite}} in these cases. Others allow the meaning “cite [as evidence, an example, etc.]” but reject “mention.”<ref>{{R:AHD}}</ref> Nevertheless, the proscribed usages are common in both writing and speech.

